Steps to Use Shared Library:
----------------------------
    Create Library:
    ---------------
        - create repo in Github
        - add vars/build.groovy

        Example:
        --------
            def call(String stageName) {
                if(stageName == "clearn") {
                    sh "mvn package"
                }
            }


    Configure in Jenkins:
    ---------------------
        Go to:
            manage jenkins --> configure system --> global pipeline libraries

    Add:
    ----
        Name: shared-lib
        Default version: main(branch name)
        Repository URL
        Credentials

    Use in pipeline:
    ----------------
    @Library('shared-lib')
    call function:
        build('clean')
        build('build')

